DATASET LICENSE
===============

Volga-IT 2026 semifinal, "Artificial Intelligence and Data Analysis".
Russian license plate detection and recognition dataset.

STATUS: DRAFT. The license for our own contributions (item 1 below) is a
proposal and still needs to be confirmed by the team before the dataset is
published or submitted. Everything in item 2 is not a choice we can make and
is binding regardless.

This dataset is a compilation of material with mixed provenance. It has two
distinct layers, licensed separately.


1. OUR OWN CONTRIBUTIONS
------------------------

The following were produced by this project and are offered under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ :

  - all annotations in meta.csv and in labels/
  - all synthetic images under images/synthetic/
  - the synthetic image generator under generator/
  - the documentation in this directory

Attribution: "Volga-IT 2026 license plate dataset".


2. THIRD-PARTY IMAGES
---------------------

Every photograph under images/real/ remains the property of its original
rights holder and is used under the license recorded for it.

  - The per-image license is the `license` column of meta.csv.
  - The origin of each image is the `source` column of meta.csv, which is a
    source_id registered in ../docs/data_sources.md.
  - The registry records, per source, whether commercial use, modification and
    attribution apply.

NO BLANKET LICENSE IS GRANTED OVER THESE IMAGES BY THIS FILE. Anyone
redistributing the dataset must honour each image's own terms. Required
attributions are listed in ../docs/data_sources.md.


3. EXCLUSIONS
-------------

  - The official 30-image debug set supplied by the competition organizers is
    NOT part of this dataset and must never be copied into it or referenced
    from meta.csv. It stays under data/official_debug/.
  - No image obtained from a closed or private source, or by bypassing a
    site's access restrictions, paywall, login wall, rate limits or
    robots.txt, is included.


4. PRIVACY
----------

Faces are blurred or covered where individuals are identifiable and the
source's license or applicable privacy rules require it. If you believe an
image in this dataset infringes your rights or privacy, contact the project
team and it will be removed.


5. NO WARRANTY
--------------

This dataset is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
implied. The authors are not liable for any claim, damages or other liability
arising from the dataset or its use.
